The runner on the host: the writer (cw_writer), the windowed runner at its
entry (cw_seg_run), the clear after a halted or left exit (cw_seg_clear, from
the runner's endpoint through cw_clear_patch) and the exits; the time bound by
cw_time_bound (A = 14c + 13, D = 0), the head bound by cw_head_bound, silence
from the endpoint and space by spaceUsed_le_of_abs_le (cw_finish). The
constant is C = A + 4c + 10 + C2 * (c + 1) + c + 2 with c = C2 + |Q| + 8.
The Implementation status paragraph records the construction.

